00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Tick Tock Tale is a animation film directed by Dean Wellins.

2
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Amidst an old London clock shop, a small, quirky mantle clock comes to the aide of the store's
more expensive clocks when a thief breaks in and threatens to steal them away.

3
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,000
The Bobby (voice), played by Dean Wellins.

4
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Tick Tock Tale is a 2010 American animated short film written and directed by Dean Wellins, produced by
Walt Disney Animation Studios, and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures.

5
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:56,000
The short had its world premiere at the Annecy International Animation Film Festival on June 8, 2010,  before it was released on Digital HD and Disney
Movies Anywhere on August 11, 2015 and on the Walt Disney Animation Studios Short Films Collection DVD/Blu-ray Combo Pack on August 18, 2015.
